join BrownStainSP2@BrownStain LLAproachSP1@LLAproach -smooth on
join BrownStainSE15_1@BrownStain LLAproachSE15_1@LLAproach -smooth on
join BrownStainSE15_2@BrownStain LLAproachSE15_1@LLAproach -smooth on

equate 22@BrowneStewart 7.23@BrownStuart
join BrowneStewartSP2@BrowneStewart BrownStuartSP1@BrownStuart  -smooth on
join BrowneStewartSE15_1@BrowneStewart BrownStuartSE15_2@BrownStuart  -smooth on
